  "title": "Barley Salad With Almonds And Apricots",
  "description": "Translucent onion slices are added to cooked barley along with plump apricots, almonds and parsley. Then a yogurt and honey dressing, infused with cinnamon, turmeric, nutmeg and lemon juice, is swirled into this yummy salad.",
  "authors": [
